        {
          "type": "tool",
          "data": {
            "content": "[{\"namespace\":[\"memories\",\"baseline-run1-b979f0\"],\"key\":\"ab2d4979-a5e2-4648-9356-b56db9ce6c39\",\"value\":{\"content\":\"Weaviate is an open-source vector database with a GraphQL-flavored API. It offers self-hosting via Docker/K8s, a managed cloud option, and a commercial tier for advanced features. It provides strong performance with p95 ~15ms at 10M vectors and 96% recall. Its hybrid search (BM25+vector) is a standout feature. However, it has a heavier operational footprint, a complex module system, and a GraphQL API that is a new paradigm for the team.\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-08-10T17:44:07.753070+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-10T17:44:07.753070+00:00\",\"score\":0.6469367567377338}]",
            "additional_kwargs": {},
            "response_metadata": {},
            "type": "tool",
            "name": "search_memory",
            "id": "eb20faac-a9ec-4fb7-bae7-2323302f65b5",
            "tool_call_id": "00c0894e-cde1-4b48-9172-86d825d6b206",
            "artifact": null,
            "status": "success"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "ai",
          "data": {
            "content": "Based on our established constraints and the evaluation of Weaviate, here's why Weaviate is the recommended choice:\n\n1. **Performance**: Weaviate offers strong performance with a p95 latency of ~15ms at 10 million vectors and 96% recall, which aligns well with our need for efficient and scalable vector search.\n\n2. **Hybrid Search**: Weaviate's hybrid search capability, combining BM25 and vector search, is a standout feature. This is particularly useful if we need to support both traditional keyword-based searches and vector similarity searches.\n\n3. **Deployment Options**: Weaviate provides both self-hosting options (via Docker/K8s) and a managed cloud option, which gives us flexibility in deployment and management based on our infrastructure and operational preferences.\n\n4. **Commercial Tier**: The availability of a commercial tier for advanced features ensures that we can scale and access additional functionalities as our needs evolve.\n\nWhile Weaviate has a heavier operational footprint and a complex module system, these trade-offs are acceptable given the benefits it offers in terms of performance, hybrid search capabilities, and deployment flexibility.",
            "additional_kwargs": {},
            "response_metadata": {
              "model": "qwen3:8b",
